0eb\u7fa4\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/pbh.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-28T00:37:13+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T06:56:18+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/vlan-interface/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/vlan-interface/", "title": "VLAN_INTERFACE \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb", "content_html": "VLAN_INTERFACE \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb \u2014 VLAN \u3092 L3 IF (SVI) \u3068\u3057\u3066\u6271\u3046\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3092\u4fdd\u6301\u3059\u308b\u3002VRF / VNET binding\u3001IP \u30a2\u30b5\u30a4\u30f3\u3001NAT zone\u3001MPLS\u3001IPv6 link-local\u3001grat ARP / proxy ARP\u3001loopback action\u3001MAC \u3092\u6301\u3064\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/vlan-interface.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-28T00:37:13+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T18:51:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/appl-acl/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/appl-acl/", "title": "APPL_DB ACL \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u7fa4", "content_html": "APPL_DB \u306e ACL_TABLE_TABLE / ACL_TABLE_TYPE_TABLE / ACL_RULE_TABLE \u2014 vnetorch\u30fbmclagsyncd\u30fbdashenifwdorch \u304c\u76f4\u63a5\u66f8\u304d\u8fbc\u3080 APPL_DB \u5074 ACL \u30a8\u30f3\u30c8\u30ea\u306e\u69cb\u9020\u30fb\u30d5\u30a3\u30fc\u30eb\u30c9\u30c7\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c8\u30fb\u30b3\u30fc\u30c9\u6319\u52d5\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/appl-acl.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-28T00:37:08+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-15T02:07:16+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}]}